WEBVTT

00:00:00.148 --> 00:00:03.698
Three money rules I wish someone told me at 22.

00:00:03.728 --> 00:00:05.548
Rule one: pay yourself first.

00:00:06.668 --> 00:00:08.328
Before rent, before anything.

00:00:09.048 --> 00:00:12.048
Rule two: if you can't buy it twice, you can't afford it.

00:00:13.028 --> 00:00:14.228
Yeah, that one hurt.

00:00:14.587 --> 00:00:16.067
Rule three: automate it.

00:00:16.507 --> 00:00:19.732
Set it up once and you never have to think about it again.

00:00:20.163 --> 00:00:23.483
Save this for payday and follow for more money tips.
